    </pathAssistantSteps>
    <pathAssistantSteps>
        <info>The buyer has come back. Work the redlines here: log every exchange with Log Version — each one records who sent it and flips Ball In Court between Us and Buyer — and stay on this step for as long as the negotiation runs. Advance only once both sides are ready to sign.</info>
